  <main>

    <section id="healthy-plate">
      <h2>Making Better Food Choices</h2>

      <article>
        <h3>The Benefits of Healthy Eating</h3>

        <figure>
          <img
            src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1540420773420-3366772f4999?w=300&h=200&fit=crop"
            alt="A healthy selection of fruits and vegetables"
            width="300"
            height="200"
          >
          <figcaption>
            Fresh and colourful foods can make meals both healthy and enjoyable.
          </figcaption>
        </figure>

        <p>
          Eating a variety of foods helps our bodies get the nutrients they need for everyday life.
          Fruits, vegetables, grains, and protein can all be included as part of a balanced diet.
        </p>

        <p>
          Find more information about healthy eating here:
          <a href="https://www.myplate.gov/" target="_blank">
            MyPlate Nutrition Guide
          </a>
        </p>
      </article>

      <article>
        <h3>Choosing Better Snacks</h3>

        <figure>
          <img
            src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1498837167922-ddd27525d352?w=300&h=200&fit=crop"
            alt="A variety of fresh and healthy foods"
            width="300"
            height="200"
          >
          <figcaption>
            Fresh fruit, yoghurt, and other nutritious foods can make great snacks.
          </figcaption>
        </figure>

        <p>
          Choosing nutritious snacks can help keep us energised during the day. Fresh fruit,
          yoghurt, nuts, and homemade snacks are some options to enjoy between meals.
        </p>

        <p>
          Explore more information about nutrition here:
          <a href="https://www.who.int/news-room/fact-sheets/detail/healthy-diet" target="_blank">
            WHO Healthy Diet Guide
          </a>
        </p>
      </article>
    </section>

    <section id="nutrition-tips">
      <h2>Simple Nutrition Tips</h2>

      <article>
        <h3>Stay Hydrated</h3>

        <p>
          Drinking enough water is important for staying hydrated throughout the day. Keeping
          a water bottle nearby can be a simple way to remember to drink regularly.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article>
        <h3>Eat a Variety of Foods</h3>

        <p>
          Eating different types of food gives our bodies a range of nutrients. Try including
          different fruits, vegetables, grains, and protein foods in your meals.
        </p>

        <p>
          Read more about healthy food choices here:
          <a href="https://www.nutrition.gov/" target="_blank">
            Nutrition.gov
          </a>
        </p>
      </article>
    </section>

